WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:01.334
Russia's state media tonight

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.235
going to great lengths

00:00:02.235 --> 00:00:03.570
to try to promote Putin's,

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:05.472
comparing him to a rock star,

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:06.673
literally just days

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.174
after facing the biggest threat ever

00:00:08.174 --> 00:00:09.509
to his presidency.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:09.943
This

00:00:11.978 --> 00:00:13.680
creek, if he has got screaming,

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:15.215
squealing, applause,

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:17.384
literally pleas for photos with him.

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.285
The president was greeted in such a way

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:23.056
that even rock stars have nothing on him.

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:25.592
Rock stars.

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:27.360
Nick Paton Walsh is OUTFRONT with more on

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.396
how Putin is trying to reassert

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:32.232
that macho image he's so known for inside

00:00:32.232 --> 00:00:33.199
Russia.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:37.504
What's a strong man

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:39.839
when he's no longer that strong?

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:42.108
Just a guy on a horse who needs a shirt

00:00:42.842 --> 00:00:44.010
We've been so accustomed

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:46.112
to these images of Vladimir Putin

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:47.614
as some sort of super man

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:49.215
manipulating the known world

00:00:49.215 --> 00:00:50.383
in a genius game of

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:51.885
five dimensional chess

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:54.821
and wrestling

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:56.990
his opponents to the mat intellectually.

00:00:57.824 --> 00:01:00.026
Now the world is coming to terms

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:02.162
with a completely new concept

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:02.562
A weak

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.363
Putin

00:01:03.363 --> 00:01:03.863
who seems

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:06.366
almost to play the clown here today

00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:07.600
at a trade fair,

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.835
making a sketch,

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.770
living in a parallel reality

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:14.174
from the near collapse of the weekend

00:01:14.574 --> 00:01:15.575
while the weekend's armed

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:17.410
rebellion by his former confidant

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:18.778
Prigozhin failed.

00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:20.914
It had one catastrophic success.

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:22.615
Bursting the bubble

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:25.652
of Putin's and ability

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:27.720
the Kremlin hat

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.189
didn't even appear in public

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:29.489
for two

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:30.523
and a half days,

00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:31.191
popping up

00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:33.293
only outside the Kremlin Tuesday

00:01:33.293 --> 00:01:34.661
to deliver a surreal

00:01:34.661 --> 00:01:36.196
thank you to the military

00:01:36.196 --> 00:01:37.964
who'd step back and let partner

00:01:37.964 --> 00:01:40.166
march on Moscow.

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.534
Putin is now in a place

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:42.936
he's never been before.

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:45.105
Hunting for traitors in his inner circle,

00:01:45.438 --> 00:01:47.340
he was said to have isolated himself

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:49.442
so much during the pandemic,

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:51.211
keeping visitors at a distance

00:01:51.211 --> 00:01:51.811
that perhaps

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:52.512
he no longer

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:54.781
can find his way back down the table

00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.015
to reality.

00:01:56.015 --> 00:01:57.083
The Moscow elite's

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:57.617
gentle

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:58.618
bubble of assured

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.820
autocracy has also been burst.

00:02:01.588 --> 00:02:03.790
It is a place where riches were earned

00:02:03.990 --> 00:02:05.925
through unquestioning loyalty.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.128
But now, after the Ukraine invasion,

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:09.662
contends with drones

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.397
attacking luxury suburbs

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.500
and even the Kremlin Putin.

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.602
None of this was meant to happen.

00:02:15.602 --> 00:02:17.871
None of this is what Putin sold Russia.

00:02:18.371 --> 00:02:20.039
But none of this could be easily

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:21.841
answered by a strong man

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.209
who no longer seems strong

00:02:25.945 --> 00:02:27.147
Now you can see

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.749
how Putin is clearly still at the task

00:02:29.749 --> 00:02:30.683
of trying to remind

00:02:30.683 --> 00:02:32.252
Russia how popular he is

00:02:32.252 --> 00:02:33.853
with those remarkable displays.

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:35.855
But you have to also ask yourself,

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:36.556
how quickly

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:37.223
is he dealing with

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.191
the ultimate challenges

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:39.092
of working out,

00:02:39.092 --> 00:02:40.627
frankly, what to do with Prigozhin

00:02:40.627 --> 00:02:42.128
or even where he is,

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:43.830
and whether or not there is genuine

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:45.698
dissent still inside his military.

00:02:45.698 --> 00:02:47.167
And that's the crucial question.

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.535
I fear he will not live

00:02:48.535 --> 00:02:49.569
with the paranoia.

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:50.837
Nick, thank you very much.

